Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:20.73,LOGO,,0,0,0,,{\fad(730,730)\fs40\pos(960,750)}ぼっち、mm子、日本留学界的良心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:24.99,LOGO,,0,0,0,,{\fad(730,730)\fs70\pos(735,700)}校对
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:24.99,LOGO,,0,0,0,,{\fad(730,730)\fs70\pos(1200,700)}时轴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:24.99,LOGO,,0,0,0,,{\fad(730,730)\fs40\pos(735,765)}爪爪
